{
  "analysis": {
    "hypothesis": "model_new.py 中现有的 conv_transpose1d_custom 算子与参考 F.conv_transpose1d 的数值语义不一致，导致 step_001 即出现大量误差。需要根据参考实现重新设计自定义算子的接口与约定，确保 conv_transpose1d 的权重索引、偏置添加、输出尺寸计算及后续 min/erf 算子正确。",
    "evidence": [
      "task_contract.json 显示参考 forward 依次为 F.conv_transpose1d、torch.min(x, 1.0)、torch.erf(x)。",
      "repair_context 诊断表明 step_001 的 conv_transpose1d 输出即失败，mismatch 比例约 92.9%，说明 conv_transpose 实现错误或调用了错误的 kernel。",
      "model.py 中 ConvTranspose1d 权重形状为 (in_channels, out_channels, kernel_size)，bias 为额外参数 self.bias（非 conv_transpose.bias），forward 显式传入 bias=self.bias。",
      "参考 F.conv_transpose1d 的调用为 x = F.conv_transpose1d(x, self.conv_transpose.weight, bias=self.bias, stride=self.conv_transpose.stride, padding=self.conv_transpose.padding, output_padding=self.conv_transpose.output_padding)。",
      "输出形状在 task_contract 中为 [128, 16, 32768]，符合输入长度 16384、stride=2、padding=1、output_padding=1、kernel_size=3 的 ConvTranspose1d 输出长度计算公式：L_out = (L_in - 1)*stride - 2*padding + kernel_size + output_padding = (16384-1)*2 - 2 + 3 + 1 = 32768。"
    ],
    "changes": [
      "移除或不再调用现有错误的 conv_transpose1d_custom 算子，改用新的自定义算子名称以明确语义边界。",
      "设计统一的算子接口：conv_transpose1d_forward、min_scalar_forward、erf_forward，并规定参数顺序和返回值结构。",
      "在 model_new.py 中保持 state_dict 键一致，只使用自定义算子实现前向计算。",
      "正常 forward 按步骤调用三个算子；debug_forward 按 checkpoint 顺序 yield 中间结果。"
    ]
  },
  "files": {
    "model_new.py": "import torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport cuda_extension\n\n\nclass ModelNew(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, in_channels, out_channels, kernel_size, stride, padding, output_padding, bias_shape):\n        super().__init__()\n        # 参考模型的 conv_transpose 模块虽然定义了 bias，但 forward 使用额外的 self.bias，\n        # 因此这里仅初始化 conv_transpose.weight，并保留 self.bias 以匹配 state_dict。\n        self.conv_transpose_weight = nn.Parameter(torch.empty(in_channels, out_channels, kernel_size))\n        # 与参考模型一致的额外 bias\n        self.bias = nn.Parameter(torch.empty(bias_shape))\n        # 存储标量参数供 forward 使用\n        self.stride = stride\n        self.padding = padding\n        self.output_padding = output_padding\n\n        # 模拟参考模型中的 nn.ConvTranspose1d，其自身也有一个未使用的 bias 参数，\n        # 为保证 state_dict 键完全一致，需要添加 conv_transpose.bias。\n        # 参考模型 state_dict 包含 conv_transpose.bias，因此这里保留一个 parameter。\n        self.conv_transpose_bias = nn.Parameter(torch.empty(out_channels))\n\n        # 初始化参数（与参考模型相同分布，但实际训练/测试会 load state_dict 覆盖）\n        nn.init.kaiming_uniform_(self.conv_transpose_weight, a=5**0.5)\n        nn.init.zeros_(self.bias)\n        nn.init.zeros_(self.conv_transpose_bias)\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        # 第一步：转置卷积，使用自定义算子，传入权重、额外 bias 和标量参数\n        x = cuda_extension.conv_transpose1d_forward(\n            x,\n            self.conv_transpose_weight,\n            self.bias,\n            self.stride,\n            self.padding,\n            self.output_padding\n        )\n        # 第二步：torch.min(x, 1.0)\n        x = cuda_extension.min_scalar_forward(x, 1.0)\n        # 第三步：torch.erf(x)\n        x = cuda_extension.erf_forward(x)\n        return x\n\n    def debug_forward(self, x):\n        # 与 forward 完全相同的计算，每步 yield (id, value)\n        x = cuda_extension.conv_transpose1d_forward(\n            x,\n            self.conv_transpose_weight,\n            self.bias,\n            self.stride,\n            self.padding,\n            self.output_padding\n        )\n        yield \"step_001\", x\n        x = cuda_extension.min_scalar_forward(x, 1.0)\n        yield \"step_002\", x\n        x = cuda_extension.erf_forward(x)\n        yield \"step_003\", x\n        yield \"step_004\", x\n"
